# "Pay 3 life: M.O.D.O.K. connives. Activate only during your turn." (CR 701.50a, 602.5b) On turn 3 Bot1 casts M.O.D.O.K. and activates twice: each pays 3
# life as a cost (20 -> 14), draws a card, then discards a card. The first discards the Lightning Bolt, a nonland card, so M.O.D.O.K. gets a
# +1/+1 counter (3/3); the second discards an Island, a land, so there is no counter. On Bot2's turn 4 the ability is refused
# (the positive control is the activations on turn 3).

